# Edge Function settings. Copy to supabase/functions/.env (or run `make env`, which also
# generates fresh secrets); `supabase start` loads it for the local stack. On a hosted
# project, set the same values with `supabase secrets set --env-file <file>` (see README).
# Defaults run everything locally against the mock Microsoft 365 service.

# --- secrets (make env replaces these) ------------------------------------------------
SESSION_SECRET=replace-with-64-random-characters-replace-with-64-random-characters
# Fernet keys, comma-separated; the first encrypts, all decrypt (rotation).
DATA_ENCRYPTION_KEYS=replace-with-a-fernet-key
# Shared secret pg_cron sends to the `cron` function. Must equal the
# calsync_cron_secret Vault secret (supabase/seed.sql sets it locally).
CRON_SECRET=local-dev-cron-secret

# --- URLs ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Where Microsoft Graph delivers webhooks: {PUBLIC_API_URL}/webhooks/graph. Defaults to
# {SUPABASE_URL}/functions/v1, which is right on a hosted project. Locally (against the
# mock) the functions are reached through the Docker host gateway.
PUBLIC_API_URL=http://host.docker.internal:54321/functions/v1
# Browser-facing URL of the web app. The source app's single redirect URI (Web
# platform) is {PUBLIC_WEB_URL}/auth/callback
PUBLIC_WEB_URL=http://localhost:3000

# Identity + Graph endpoints. For real Microsoft 365 remove these three lines.
LOGIN_BASE_URL=http://host.docker.internal:8001
LOGIN_BROWSER_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8001
GRAPH_BASE_URL=http://host.docker.internal:8001/v1.0

# --- app registration ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Multi-tenant app users sign in and link calendars with. DELEGATED permissions only:
# openid, profile, email, offline_access, User.Read, Calendars.Read. No application
# permissions and no admin consent. Confidential client, so it needs a secret or a
# certificate. Must match the values the mock is started with (root .env).
SOURCE_APP_CLIENT_ID=22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222
SOURCE_APP_CLIENT_SECRET=mock-source-secret
# Or certificate credentials (preferred in production): a PEM with the PKCS#8 private key
# and the certificate (newlines as \n), and optionally its SHA-1 thumbprint (hex).
# SOURCE_APP_CERT_PEM=
# SOURCE_APP_CERT_THUMBPRINT=

# Users signing in with these addresses become operators (comma-separated).
OPERATOR_EMAILS=ops@calsync.example

# --- database --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Defaults to SUPABASE_DB_URL, which Supabase provides to every function; leave it unset
# on a hosted project. Locally that URL's host (supabase_db_<project>) isn't a valid DNS
# name for Deno's resolver, so use the container's `db` alias instead.
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:postgres@db:5432/postgres

# --- sync tuning (PRD defaults) --------------------------------------------------------
SYNC_WINDOW_PAST_DAYS=90
SYNC_WINDOW_FUTURE_DAYS=365
SUBSCRIPTION_LIFETIME_MINUTES=4200
SUBSCRIPTION_RENEW_INTERVAL_HOURS=24
DELTA_RESYNC_INTERVAL_HOURS=6
